<title>USA: IPO PRICING - ProMedCo 4.0 mln shrs at $9.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - ProMedCo 4.0 mln shrs at $9.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ProMedCo Management Co said it offered nine million shares in its initial public offering at $9 per share.</p>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc, Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co and Cowen &amp; Co managed the deal.</p>
<p>ProMedCo is a physician practice management company that facilitates the consolidation of physician groups into primary care-driven, multi-specialty networks.</p>
